{"unit_id":"deepmean__dshModeltemperature#card-zh","repo":"deepmean/dshModeltemperature","commit":"c96501d929eb4b07498691d6b6381037c2e7af39","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-per-model-temperature 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的模型温度插件。它在设置页提供按提供商与模型分别维护的温度配置，并监听 agent/request，在请求发出前按当前路由和模型应用对应数值；未匹配或留空时移除温度字段，交由上游默认处理。设置页可浏览运行时路由与模型，也支持自定义温度。适合需要为不同模型控制采样温度的 DSH 用户。安装需本地获取仓库并加入 profile；无需额外密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:147-199","client.js:944-982","cordis.patch.yml:3-8"]}
{"unit_id":"deepmean__dshModeltemperature#card-en","repo":"deepmean/dshModeltemperature","commit":"c96501d929eb4b07498691d6b6381037c2e7af39","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-per-model-temperature adds per-model temperature controls to DSH settings. A request listener applies the matching value before each model call and removes it when unset. The page lists runtime routes and models and accepts custom values. Install from a local repository; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:147-199","client.js:944-982","cordis.patch.yml:3-8"]}
